  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Banco Supervielle &#x2013; A/B Loan for SME Financing in Argentina</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed transaction consists of a senior unsecure A/B loan, up to US$ 150 million (the &#x201c;Loan&#x201d;), financed as follows: (i) a committed loan up to US$50 million to be financed by IDB Invest, and (ii) a B loan up of approximately US$ 100 millions to be financed by institutional investors.The loan has a tenor of up to three years, amortizable, and renewable for two additional periods. The project aims to increase Banco Supervielle available financing so that it can increase its SME&#x2019;s portfolio in the country. Additionally, IDB Invest is designing advisory services to support the Supervielle&#x2019;s sustainability strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
